      "entrypoint": "examples/hello-display/main.cpp",
      "upstream": "https://github.com/waveshareteam/ESP32-S3-Touch-AMOLED-2.16/blob/e8e5d132978b768cce18901602b89fdb318ad41a/examples/arduino/01_HelloWorld/01_HelloWorld.ino"
    }
  ]
}
